 "summary": "This is a late-chapter excerpt from a longer science fiction novel, functioning as a philosophical coda rather than a self-contained narrative\u2014it is a meditation on institutional knowledge, epistemic humility, and the ethics of information, rendered in controlled, literary prose. Its greatest strength is its causal architecture and thematic coherence; its greatest weakness is the near-total absence of emotional stakes or unresolved tension, which means the reader is never in suspense and the book accumulates rather than builds. A reader who shares the book's intellectual preoccupations will find it rewarding; a reader seeking narrative momentum will find it inert.",
